{"id":"c16f5413c282b84f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Closure System","display":"df-zfc-order9-closure-system — ZFC Order9 Closure System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-closure-system — ZFC Order9 Closure System","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-closure-system — ZFC Order9 Closure System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> is the power-set operation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}closure\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\;\n(\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}closure\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\;\n(\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The empty intersection is represented by the separate clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>, avoiding an intersection over an empty family with no ambient set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ is the power-set operation (see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}closure\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\;\n(\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C)","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":976,"backlinks":[{"id":"1d8bac3f41859549","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ClosureSystem}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (closure-system predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2966","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system.md|58-df-zfc-order9-closure-system]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}